Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:24.61,Default2,,0,0,0,,耍小聰明！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:25.39,Ripple,,0,0,0,,欸!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:26.23,Default2,,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:27.30,Ripple,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.48,Meteor,,0,0,0,,啊!? Ripple！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:41.67,Ripple,,0,0,0,,嗚... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:47.55,Meteor,,0,0,0,,想對我們家的Ripple... 做什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:55.00,Meteor,,0,0,0,,沒事吧!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:18:57.81,Ripple,,0,0,0,,沒問題的問題... 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:19:01.06,Zeal,,0,0,0,,只剩... 那個人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.51,Ripple,,0,0,0,,要糾結 等回頭再說吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:17.41,Zeal,,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:19.55,Meteor,,0,0,0,,理解萬歲！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:36.67,Ripple,,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:36.67,Ripple,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:51.69,LIVE Ripple Jp,,0,0,0,,こんなにも溢れてゆく チカラ {\3c&H0203E4&}チカラ {\3c&H0AD8A6&}チカラ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:57.98,LIVE Zeal Jp,,0,0,0,,聴こえる… 力強いメロディー {\3c&H0AD8A6&}メロディー {\3c&HEFA639&}メロディー
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:04.37,LIVE Meteor Jp,,0,0,0,,１＋１＋１は {\3c&HEFA639&}３じゃなくて{\3c&H0203E4&}無限大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:51.69,LIVE Ripple,,0,0,0,,不斷湧現出如此強大的力量 {\3c&H0203E4&}力量 {\3c&H0AD8A6&}力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:57.98,LIVE Zeal,,0,0,0,,聽見了... 強而有力的旋律 {\3c&H0AD8A6&}旋律 {\3c&HEFA639&}旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:04.37,LIVE Meteor,,0,0,0,,1+1+1 {\3c&HEFA639&}不是3{\3c&H0203E4&}而是無窮大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:38.67,Ripple,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:40.51,Ripple,,0,0,0,,-喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:48.29,Default2,,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:07.13,Default2,,0,0,0,,嗚... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:11.52,Default2,,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.68,0:20:13.01,Ripple,,0,0,0,,-啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:26.91,Default2,,0,0,0,,一個人的力量 果然還是不足夠嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:31.35,Default2,,0,0,0,,這種事情！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:35.42,Default2,,0,0,0,,不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.43,Ripple,,0,0,0,,哇！啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:44.83,Meteor,,0,0,0,,別 別 別... 嗚哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:47.43,Zeal,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:51.49,Ripple,,0,0,0,,好痛...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:58.53,Zeal,,0,0,0,,還好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:20:59.83,Meteor,,0,0,0,,沒受傷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:01.37,Ripple,,0,0,0,,沒事...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:12.89,Meteor,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗚... 遭大殃了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是她... 是Sincere嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:31.64,Meteor,,0,0,0,,是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:37.31,Zeal,,0,0,0,,很不願意相信... 但是都親眼看到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:44.37,Ripple,,0,0,0,,風花師姐... 是那麼友善地對待愛麗絲比亞人...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:48.21,Ripple,,0,0,0,,為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:58.81,Ripple,,0,0,0,,你在做的事 不就是會令大家傷心的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.28,Zeal,,0,0,0,,風花師姐 為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:38.55,Ripple,,0,0,0,,肯定有難言之隱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.69,Ripple,,0,0,0,,下集 兩朵花
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.74,0:23:41.83,Zeal,,0,0,0,,會是什麼緣由...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.01,0:23:47.06,Meteor,,0,0,0,,應試的壓力 禁忌的戀情 不給漲的零用錢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:49.02,Zeal,,0,0,0,,嗯... 不便插手啊
